WEBVTT

00:03:26.871 --> 00:03:32.371
It's about considering really deeply how
you can align your personal values with

00:03:32.371 --> 00:03:36.163
your professional ambitions
in a post 2020 economy.

00:03:36.954 --> 00:03:40.204
And that is going to mean very different
things for different people.

00:03:44.038 --> 00:03:45.579
A couple of months ago, one hundred

00:03:45.579 --> 00:03:49.871
and fifty listeners volunteered to
beta test the Zig-Zag project.

00:03:50.288 --> 00:03:52.663
They gave me feedback on the assignments.

00:03:53.038 --> 00:03:55.038
They shared their hopes and their fears,

00:03:55.371 --> 00:03:58.121
and they took a pretty lengthy
survey anonymously,

00:03:58.288 --> 00:04:01.288
which turned up lots of fascinating
data points.